y$, hold $x$ constant.\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\nabla\\cdot F & =\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial x}+\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial y} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}(\\left(4 x + y\\right)^{2})+\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}(\\left(3 x + 4 y\\right)^{2}) \\\\  & =32 x + 8 y+\\left(24 x + 32 y\\right) \\\\  & =8 \\left(7 x + 5 y\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate $\\text{div}\\,F$ at the point $(2,1),$ and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\nabla\\cdot F)(2,1) & =40 (1) + 56 (2) \\\\ & =72+\\left(80\\right) \\\\ & =152.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["ca1f744b-0571-5f1c-9cbd-a75475e65e6e"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "11a14153-868e-557f-9e7e-a963a2420b97" :answer/id #uuid "11a14153-868e-557f-9e7e-a963a2420b97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- \\frac{73}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "675a4586-bc07-5a8e-a9c6-d9654edb99b9" :answer/id #uuid "675a4586-bc07-5a8e-a9c6-d9654edb99b9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "01e55554-e197-5f70-be8c-57881ebe28e7" :answer/id #uuid "01e55554-e197-5f70-be8c-57881ebe28e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{73}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e4e215ca-8076-5b63-89d2-0b7ccc3a5112" :answer/id #uuid "e4e215ca-8076-5b63-89d2-0b7ccc3a5112" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- \\frac{71}{2}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8ff0bf56-f2aa-5cad-873f-81a3ab632ebf" :answer/id #uuid "8ff0bf56-f2aa-5cad-873f-81a3ab632ebf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "37" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b5d1f39b-26c1-5d7f-a544-4f6a511c0717" :answer-field/id #uuid "b5d1f39b-26c1-5d7f-a544-4f6a511c0717" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["11a14153-868e-557f-9e7e-a963a2420b97" "675a4586-bc07-5a8e-a9c6-d9654edb99b9" "01e55554-e197-5f70-be8c-57881ebe28e7" "e4e215ca-8076-5b63-89d2-0b7ccc3a5112" "8ff0bf56-f2aa-5cad-873f-81a3ab632ebf"] :answer-field/correct "01e55554-e197-5f70-be8c-57881ebe28e7" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "71332596-10b4-5473-a699-991346f64d01" :question/id #uuid "71332596-10b4-5473-a699-991346f64d01" :question/problem "Consider the vector field $F=\\left(\\ln{\\left(3 x + y \\right)}\\right)\\,i+\\left(3 x^{2} e^{3 y}\\right)\\,j.$ \nEvaluate $\\nabla\\cdot F$ at the point $(2,0).$" :question/worked-solution "If $F=P\\,i+Q\\,j$ is a vector field on ${R}^{2}$ and the partial derivatives of the components of $F$ all exist, then the divergence of $F$ is the scalar field given by\n\n$$\n\\text{div}\\,F=\\nabla\\cdot F=\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial x}+\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial y}.\n$$\n\nWhen differentiating $P$ with respect to $x$, hold $y$ constant; when differentiating $Q$ with respect to $y$, hold $x$ constant.\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\nabla\\cdot F & =\\frac{\\partial P}{\\partial x}+\\frac{\\partial Q}{\\partial y} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}(\\ln{\\left(3 x + y \\right)})+\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}(3 x^{2} e^{3 y}) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{3 x + y}+\\left(9 x^{2} e^{3 y}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{3 \\left(9 x^{3} e^{3 y} + 3 x^{2} y e^{3 y} + 1\\right)}{3 x + y}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we evaluate $\\text{div}\\,F$ at the point $(2,0),$ and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(\\nabla\\cdot F)(2,0) & =\\frac{3 \\left(3 (0) (2)^{2} e^{3 (0)} + 9 (2)^{3} e^{3 (0)} + 1\\right)}{(0) + 3 (2)} \\\\ & =\\frac{1}{2}+\\left(36\\right) \\\\ & =\\frac{73}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["b5d1f39b-26c1-5d7f-a544-4f6a511c0717"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "d43f4cc6-d224-5cf6-af6b-e7e47c04208c" :answer/id #uuid "d43f4cc6-d224-5cf6-af6b-e7e47c04208c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "126" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fe8913ba-f1ef-54f0-930d-e0d7c7ed078a" :answer/id